    "text": "Join us 🔴LIVE🔴 Today, November 17th,  from 2:00 p.m. CDT / 20:00 UTC on NSF’s Starbase Live stream for another Raptorside Chat.\nWe’ll discuss all the latest developments at Starbase and beyond and try to answer any questions you may have!\nnsf.live/starbase",
