    "text": "Following a mixed week for spaceflight, highlighted by milestones for SpaceX’s Starship and setbacks for ULA’s Vulcan, attention shifts to upcoming missions. \n\nBy John Sharp\n\nwww.nasaspaceflight.com/2026/11/laun...",
