    "text": "Join us 🔴LIVE🔴  NOW from Starbase, Texas, on Sunday, November 15, as SpaceX rolls back Starship Ship 42 to the production site, following its successful catch with the Chopsticks yesterday. \nwww.youtube.com/watch?v=1GRc...",
